Package: tennisages
Title: Career Matches and Age Gaps of Tennis Players
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Aarya", "Pradhan", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads a player's career match data from tennisabstract.com,
    cleans it into a data frame of player and opponent ages, and plots each
    match by the player's age and the age gap with the opponent.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3